      "writtenOn": "2014-12-18T22:40:29Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "How long will flash operations potentially take?\n\nThis code spin-waits, so potentially can trigger a watchdog event if it takes a long time for ready.\n\nMost operations should be fast.  It\u0027s the erase operations I\u0027m potentially concerned about.  Those may need to use a different flash_wait_ready() which does a msleep(1) inside the inner loop so that other tasks (including the watchdog) can run.",
